*.pyc
tools/**/.cache/

# Ad-hoc investigation output (MML v21 PoC, SYKE coverage research, border-
# crossing screenshots). Several of these files embed a real, working MML
# API key directly in saved tile-URL templates (MML's own TileJSON/style
# response format does this) — per the fetch scripts' own explicit "do not
# commit" instructions. Never a build input; safe to delete/regenerate.
/investigation/